"""Hero phrase bank — the editorial opener of every post.

Thirteen scenario codes × three length tiers × 15 entries each =
585 templates (a1-a12 + fallback; see ADR-0008 for the four
expansion detectors a9-a12). Each template is a `.format(**data)`-ready string.

Conventions:
* `{de_artista}` is pre-rendered by the scenario detector via
  `apostrof_de(artista)` — templates write `de {de_artista}` is
  WRONG; write `{de_artista}` directly when you want "de X" or
  "d'X". (Or `{artista}` for the bare name.)
* Subject of any finite verb is either invariant (`«{canco}»`,
  `el cim`, `el top`, `la setmana`) or the artist in singular —
  per the Fase 4 reset decision, we accept `OBESES debuta`,
  `Manel actua`, `Els Catarres entra` (forced but acceptable).
* No em-dashes; we use the short-dash `—` only as a typographic
  separator, not as Catalan punctuation.
* 1–2 emojis per entry; no emoji appears more than twice within
  the same scenario bank.

The composer picks one entry per scenario via the registry and
interpolates the scenario data."""

from __future__ import annotations

